  ...toolTexts(TOOL4.chatSearch, "Search this chat's messages by words, best match first: every message, those too old to be in the request among them. Several queries in one call are each answered on their own. Hits are grouped by stretch of the chat, so one exchange doesn't fill the page; each hit shows its message's citation and its best lines. chat_around reads around a hit, chat_read reads messages whole. Narrow with from, to and speaker.", { queries: QUERIES, from: FROM, to: TO, speaker: SPEAKER, cursor: CURSOR_ARG }),
